{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>Epic Games CEO Tim Sweeney本周在社交媒體公開發文稱，Valve的Steam「多年來一直在拖累遊戲行業」。</strong>討論起源於Epic前首席動畫程式設計師Kiaran Ritchie，Ritchie批評Valve從遊戲銷售中抽取30%的分成，表示「一周就能用vibe coding寫出一個Steam替代品」，並稱行業急需一個讓開發者保留收入的分發平台。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584450.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:57.037301+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:50:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_hash":"eb32e8f32eeddc7b5bd8740c1be41b6f6a314cbbaa35afc8f76511f3601b70a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}